    {
      "name": "10. Resend inbound webhook (unsigned, local/dev only)",
      "description": "Only works when RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET is unset on the server (dev mode). For production, register the webhook in the Resend dashboard instead of posting to this manually \u2014 real requests are svix-signed.",
